@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+## Context
+
+`src/patch.ts` already handles JSON values with `structuredClone` and defines `__proto__`-safe members via `Object.defineProperty`.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- New `src/merge-patch.ts` with a recursive function; re-export from `src/index.ts`.
+- Clone with `structuredClone` for inputs and result to avoid shared structure.
+- Set members with `Object.defineProperty` and test keys with `Object.hasOwn`, so `__proto__` is plain data.
+- No errors are thrown: RFC 7386 defines every input as valid.
