+## Why
+
+Some clients send partial updates as RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch documents. The library only supports RFC 6902 patches.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `applyMergePatch(target, patch)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, implementing RFC 7386.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `json-merge-patch`: applying an RFC 7386 merge patch to a JSON document.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+New file `src/merge-patch.ts`, export in `src/index.ts`, new tests. No dependencies.
